  "text" : "Recall is asking, of all the positives, how many did I actually catch?\n10,000 requests come in, but only 50 are attacks.\nIf there were 50 attacks and we only caught 40, recall is about 80%.\nNow, precision is saying, of the ones that I did predict were positive,\nhow many actually were positive?\nWe flagged 100, 40 were attacks, precision is 40%.\nNeither one uses the true negatives.\nIn this case, there's almost 10,000 of them.\nThat's why they still work when the attacks are rare.\nRecall is all about what you missed.\nThese are the attacks I got through, and precision is about what you wasted.\nThese are real users that you ended up blocking."
